  "$id": "urn:wgc:inventory:1",
  "title": "WGC independent page and region inventory",
  "description": "Integer-only geometry and exact artifact pins. Cross-record, hash, overlap, identity, exclusion freshness and page-completeness checks require wgc.sources.inventory.validate. No semantic acceptance.",
